zephyr~
Zephyr~
Zephyr is standing here, with flowers blooming at his bare feet.
~
Dressed in ragged brown robes, with his thin limbs poking out from the
sleeves, this man seems a very humorous sight. But as he looks at you, you
seem to peer into his soul and see a very strong man, who has lived throughout
a long and hard life without many friends. His eyes glimmer with a vast
intelligence as he watches you.
~
